<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσσύμενος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and Lyr. part.
		
			Pass.
		 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεύω</span> (in sense and accent
			pres., but redupl. as if pf.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hurrying, eager, impetuous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.518
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.135
			</span></i> ; <i>eager, yearning for,</i> c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμου, ὁδοῖο,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.404
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.733
			</span></i>: also c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμίζειν, ἀλύξαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.717
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.416
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.73
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαύνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					107.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσσῠμένως</span>
			<i>furiously, eagerly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμάχοντο, δόρπον ἕλοντο,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.698
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.347
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				166
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.43
			</span></i>.</div>
